  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through COMMUNITY WELLBEING in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMUNITY WELLBEING focuses on engaging youth through sports and arts. Efforts will be geared towards using sports as a tool for development to education the community on diverse human rights topics as well as safe space.  Through Safe spaces, youth and young women will be able to share their own challenges and experiences in a supportive environment.  The scouting groups will have an emphasis on inclusion of PWDs as well as promoting environmental friendly practices among youth. In both safe spaces and scouting groups, partners ensure inclusion of youth with disabilities in the youth groups.</narrative>
  </description>
